
Your Choice
DESTINATION
WE have a form having three buttons :
1 bicycle :if you click it ,it will go directly to the Bicycle rent form  
2 mushroom: if you click it,it will go directly to the mushroom identifier form
3 exit: this will be used to terminate the program
Bicycle rental

Put in the hour you start and the hour you end, then press Save. The price per hour depends on the time:

0 to 7 and 21 to 24: 500 RWF
7 to 14 and 19 to 21: 1000 RWF
14 to 19: 1500 RWF

Example: 8 to 12 is 4 hours, so 4 x 1000 = 4000 RWF.

If you enter hours that don't exist it says invalid hours, and if you type something that isn't a number it asks for numbers only.

Mushroom identifier

Answer the 4 questions with y or n (gills, forest, ring, convex cup) and press Save.

no gills: Cepe de Bordeaux
not in a forest and has a ring: Coprin chevelu
anything else: Girolle
